What is Agile?

Agile is a software development methodology that focuses on delivering software in small, incremental releases through collaboration, customer feedback, and iterative development.

Agile Goals
Deliver software faster
Adapt to changing requirements
Improve customer satisfaction
Deliver working software frequently
